@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & LOGIN FOR DIFFERENT USERS
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 1a. Login as Super Admin (Has all roles & full permissions)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### 1b. Login as Operations Manager (Has Users.View, Reports.View, Reports.Export)
# @name managerLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@example.com",
  "password": "Manager@123456"
}

### 1c. Login as Standard Employee (Has Users.View only)
# @name userLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@123456"
}

### Set active token for requests below (switch between admin, manager, user)
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.accessToken}}


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. TESTING DYNAMIC POLICIES (IAuthorizationPolicyProvider)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 2a. Dynamic Permission: 'Users.View'
### SUCCESS for Admin, Manager, and Standard User
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/resources/users-list
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2b. Dynamic Permission: 'Reports.Export'
### SUCCESS for Admin and Manager, 403 FORBIDDEN for Standard User
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/resources/export-financial-report
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2c. Dynamic Permission: 'Users.Create'
### SUCCESS for Admin, 403 FORBIDDEN for Manager and Standard User
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/resources/create-user-record
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2d. Dynamic Permission: 'Users.Delete'
### SUCCESS for Admin, 403 FORBIDDEN for Standard User
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/resources/delete-user-record/123
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. DYNAMICALLY GRANTING PERMISSIONS AT RUNTIME
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 3a. Admin grants 'Users.Create' permission to user@example.com
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/grant-permission
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "permission": "Users.Create"
}

### 3b. After user logs in again, they can now call 'create-user-record'!
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@123456"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. IDEMPOTENCY TESTING (Double-Charge & Network Retry Protection)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 4a. Initial Payment Charge (First Request -> Processed Normally)
### Expect: 200 OK with X-Cache: IDEMPOTENT-MISS and a new transactionId
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/payments/charge
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pay-key-unique-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 99.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "orderReference": "ORD-2026-9876",
  "description": "Premium Subscription"
}

### 4b. Immediate Retry of Payment Charge (Exact Same Idempotency-Key & Payload)
### Expect: 200 OK with X-Cache: IDEMPOTENT-HIT and the EXACT SAME transactionId (No double-charge!)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/payments/charge
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pay-key-unique-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 99.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "orderReference": "ORD-2026-9876",
  "description": "Premium Subscription"
}

### 4c. Conflict Test: Same Idempotency-Key with MODIFIED Payload ($150 instead of $99.99)
### Expect: 422 Unprocessable Entity (Key reuse detected with altered parameters)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/payments/charge
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pay-key-unique-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "orderReference": "ORD-2026-9876",
  "description": "Premium Subscription"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. GLOBAL EXCEPTION HANDLING & RFC 7807/9457 PROBLEM DETAILS
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 5a. Test 404 Not Found Exception
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/errors/not-found
Accept: application/json

### 5b. Test 409 Conflict Exception
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/errors/conflict
Accept: application/json

### 5c. Test 400 Domain Rule Violation Exception
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/errors/domain-error
Accept: application/json

### 5d. Test 403 Forbidden Exception
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/errors/forbidden
Accept: application/json

### 5e. Test 500 Server Error (Unhandled Exception masked for security)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/errors/server-error
Accept: application/json

### 5f. Test FluentValidation Error (Empty Register Command)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123",
  "confirmPassword": "456"
}
